{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご挨拶いってまいりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0052.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0077.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪の皆さんは超熱いですねヾ(´ω｀＝´ω｀)ノ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にノリ最高過ぎますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0295.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方がとても沢山いらっしゃいましたね(゜-゜)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0130.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0251.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたま通りかかった方もわざわざ並んで下さって、嬉しかったです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に大阪の熱気を感じられてめっちゃ楽しかったです!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪に来てくださった方ありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨がパラパラ降っていたみたいですが、風邪には気をつけて下さいね(´・ω・)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0100.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中待って下さって、手が冷えてる方もいらっしゃったのでそこが凄く心配です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0198.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かくして寝てくださいね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は大阪にお邪魔させていただきましたが、次!!名古屋にお邪魔させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0256.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0295.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は二次審査が名古屋だったので凄い懐かしく感じると思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0283.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!こちらもまた楽しみです(σ*´∀｀)わくわく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月は闘魂パワーで頑張るぞ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろ、大阪の方にはパワーを頂いたので名古屋でもまた頂いちゃうかもですねヾ(´ω｀＝´ω｀)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0230.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋にいらっしゃる方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0236.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします・゜・(つД｀)・゜・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋や大阪は遠いよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0198.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って方!!30日のZepp東京で待ってますよぉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0205.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"30日はまたお見立て会のような初々しさ溢れる乃木坂46からレッスン等々で、レベルアップした乃木坂46を見ていただけるかと思います(｀・ω・´)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0296.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非お越しくださいね♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、みんな大好きだ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみゅうみゅう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0195.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0194.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※大阪の皆さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても暖かい声援を本当にありがとうございました！嬉しいという言葉を通り越して、最高でした!乃木坂46はもっともっと大きくなってまた大阪に帰ってくると約束します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/24/dimg0218.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時はまた熱い大阪を見せてくださいね♪機会があったら東京のイベントにも遊びに来てくださいね！待ってますよぉ！今日はゆっくり休んでください(・∀・∩)でわ!!"}],"source":"archive"}